Package: HaugShape
Type: Package
Title: Advanced Shape Analysis and Morphometric Visualization Tools
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Colin", "Hassenbach", email = "colin.hassenbach@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = ""))
Description: Provides comprehensive tools for advanced shape analyses and 
    morphometric visualizations in R. Features include customizable plotting 
    functions for visualizing shapes, convex hulls, and contours, with support 
    for multiple group comparisons and publication-ready figure generation. 
    Includes integration with 'Momocs' for morphometric analysis, interactive 
    'Shiny' applications, and extensive image processing capabilities for 
    shape preparation and analysis workflows.
